@startuml API Flow Diagram

title Nova Sonic VoIP Gateway - API Flow and Tool Invocation

participant "NovaSonicVoipGateway" as Gateway
participant "NovaStreamerFactory" as Factory
participant "NovaS2SBedrockInteractClient" as BedrockClient
participant "DateTimeNovaS2SEventHandler" as EventHandler
participant "BedrockRuntime" as Bedrock
participant "AudioStreamer" as Streamer
participant "NovaSonicAudioInput" as AudioInput
participant "NovaSonicAudioOutput" as AudioOutput

== Initialization ==
[-> Gateway: main()
activate Gateway
Gateway -> Gateway: configure from env/args
Gateway -> Factory: new NovaStreamerFactory()
activate Factory

== SIP Registration ==
Gateway -> Gateway: registerWithKeepAlive()
Gateway -> Gateway: scheduleKeepAlive()

== Incoming Call Flow ==
[-> Gateway: onUaIncomingCall()
Gateway -> Factory: createMediaStreamer()
activate Factory

Factory -> BedrockClient: new NovaS2SBedrockInteractClient()
activate BedrockClient

Factory -> EventHandler: new DateTimeNovaS2SEventHandler()
activate EventHandler

Factory -> EventHandler: getToolConfiguration()
EventHandler --> Factory: tool specs (getDateTool, getTimeTool)

Factory -> BedrockClient: interactMultimodal()
BedrockClient -> Bedrock: start session
activate Bedrock

Factory -> Streamer: new AudioStreamer()
activate Streamer

Factory -> AudioInput: new NovaSonicAudioInput()
activate AudioInput

Factory -> AudioOutput: new NovaSonicAudioOutput()
activate AudioOutput

== Tool Invocation Flow ==
[-> EventHandler: handleToolInvocation()
EventHandler -> EventHandler: switch(toolName)
note right: Handle getDateTool\nor getTimeTool

alt getDateTool
    EventHandler -> EventHandler: handleGetDateTool()
    EventHandler --> BedrockClient: date information
else getTimeTool
    EventHandler -> EventHandler: handleGetTimeTool()
    EventHandler --> BedrockClient: time information
end

BedrockClient -> Bedrock: process tool response
Bedrock --> AudioOutput: generate audio response

== Audio Streaming ==
AudioInput -> BedrockClient: stream audio input
BedrockClient -> Bedrock: process audio
Bedrock --> AudioOutput: stream audio output

@enduml